'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[light armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Both the body armor and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page two of the [[Righteous Revenants Legendary Warbond#Page 2|Righteous Revenants]] Legendary [[Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|55|notext}} and 45 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

==Passive Ability==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Acclimated}}

==Trivia==
*This armor is part of the [[Killzone]] crossover, designed to mirror the [https://killzone.fandom.com/Helghast_Sniper Helghast Sniper.]
*Although originally slated for the second rotation of the crossover's ''Premium [[Superstore]]'', the items were ultimately given out as a holiday gift following backlash over the steep pricing of the first rotation.
*The armor set's previous description read: "The helmet is equipped with heptafocal specialty lenses, making it a favorite among long-distance snipers and micro-sculpture enthusiasts alike."

